            <p>It gives me immense pleasure to welcome all the students of Under-graduate and Post-graduate courses and Research streams. Campus is Located in the heart of the city. The infrastructure that the college has is second to none. We have a dedicated faculty who open the door for the students but at the same time expect them to enter it by themselves. There is no force more paralyzing than the fear of failure. We mound our students to be self confident and pragmatic such that when they enter life after their studies, they face various challenges with courage, conviction and success.</p>
